# Test and QA artefacts
# `scripts/make-fixtures.mjs` can copy test files into public/ so the
# browser-driven audits can fetch them. Those are QA assets, never site
# content — `scripts/verify.sh` fails the build if any are found in public/.
.qa-fixtures/
public/anim.gif
public/tone.wav
public/sample.pdf
public/normal.zip
public/traversal.zip
public/absolute.zip
public/not-really.zip

